{ identifier: user.login.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toUpperCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), password: user.password })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      })</span></span></code></pre>",
